cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use onmodel in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "onmodel: checking AI-generated on-model product photos against the real product"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/molly554/onmodel"
url: "https://github.com/molly554/onmodel"
authors:
  - name: "molly554"
abstract: >-
  A rubric, a scorer, a text rule, a benchmark runner and starter recipes for checking whether an
  AI-generated photo of a person wearing or holding a product still shows the real product.
  Version 0.1.0 includes a preliminary pilot test; its numbers are directions, not pass rates.
keywords:
  - ai-product-photography
  - image-evaluation
  - benchmark
  - llm-as-a-judge
  - ecommerce
